# Volkswagen Golf Mk4 five-door hatchback, 1997-2003.
#
# 4,149 mm long, 1,735 mm wide, 1,441 mm high, 2,511 mm wheelbase; 1.4-3.2
# petrol and 1.9 diesel.
# https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Volkswagen_Golf_Mk4
#
# Colours: Tornado Red, Reflex Silver, Black and Candy White are period Golf
# colours.
#
# Weight: 330 in total (red 95, silver 90, black 75, white 70).
#
# Speed 190 km/h; comfort 110/345 (line). Classes 1,2.
# Dates: 1997-2003 with a road tail to about 2012.
#
# Metres master: citycars/4.5/vw-golf-mk4.blend. References:
# citycars/references/vw-golf-mk4/ (gitignored). Images via Wikimedia Commons.

